    },
    {
      "id": "saga_step_1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 215,
      "y": 1130,
      "width": 858.921875,
      "height": 39.199999999999996,
      "text": "①  Buyer (with JWT bearer) submits POST /api/v1/orders to OrderService. Endpoint validates buyer-scope: \n    JWT sub claim must match command.BuyerId, else 403.",
      "originalText": "①  Buyer (with JWT bearer) submits POST /api/v1/orders to OrderService. Endpoint validates buyer-scope: \n    JWT sub claim must match command.BuyerId, else 403.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 900003,
      "version": 5,
      "versionNonce": 812424579,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [],
      "boundElements": [],
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.4,
      "index": "b0F",
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "updated": 1779414704664,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "saga_step_2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 214.8527208591065,
      "y": 1184.701109978775,
      "width": 891.734375,
      "height": 39.199999999999996,
      "text": "②  PlaceOrderHandler calls CatalogService over gRPC, once per line: GetProduct (validate exists + available \n    + stock) then ReserveStock (xmin token enforces atomicity).",
      "originalText": "②  PlaceOrderHandler calls CatalogService over gRPC, once per line: GetProduct (validate exists + available \n    + stock) then ReserveStock (xmin token enforces atomicity).",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 900005,
      "version": 6,
      "versionNonce": 2050996099,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [],
      "boundElements": [],
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.4,
      "index": "b0G",
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "updated": 1779414738242,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "saga_step_3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 215,
      "y": 1240,
      "width": 842.515625,
      "height": 39.199999999999996,
      "text": "③  Order.Create() validates invariants. Order + lines persisted to orders-db. OrderPlacedEvent staged \n    into wolverine.outgoing_envelopes — same DB transaction. Atomic.",
      "originalText": "③  Order.Create() validates invariants. Order + lines persisted to orders-db. OrderPlacedEvent staged \n    into wolverine.outgoing_envelopes — same DB transaction. Atomic.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 900007,
      "version": 5,
      "versionNonce": 514606083,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [],
      "boundElements": [],
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.4,
      "index": "b0H",
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "updated": 1779414713146,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "saga_step_4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 215,
      "y": 1294.8700478168587,
      "width": 842.515625,
      "height": 39.199999999999996,
      "text": "④  Wolverine background dispatcher reads from outgoing_envelopes, publishes OrderPlacedEvent to topic \n    order-events on the Service Bus. Marks PublishedAt.",
      "originalText": "④  Wolverine background dispatcher reads from outgoing_envelopes, publishes OrderPlacedEvent to topic \n    order-events on the Service Bus. Marks PublishedAt.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 900009,
      "version": 6,
      "versionNonce": 1142326669,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [],
      "boundElements": [],
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.4,
      "index": "b0I",
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "updated": 1779414723429,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "saga_step_5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 215,
      "y": 1350,
      "width": 727.671875,
      "height": 39.199999999999996,
      "text": "⑤  Two consumers receive the event in parallel: PaymentService (payment-orders-sub) and \n    NotificationService (notify-orders-sub) — \"order received\" email.",
      "originalText": "⑤  Two consumers receive the event in parallel: PaymentService (payment-orders-sub) and \n    NotificationService (notify-orders-sub) — \"order received\" email.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 900011,
      "version": 5,
      "versionNonce": 1740745795,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [],
      "boundElements": [],
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.4,
      "index": "b0J",
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "updated": 1779414732782,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "saga_step_6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1125,
      "y": 1130,
      "width": 1082.8125,
      "height": 39.199999999999996,
      "text": "⑥  PaymentService OrderPlacedHandler is a cascade — returns ProcessPaymentCommand. \n    Handler checks for existing Payment by OrderId (idempotency), creates Pending Payment, calls Stripe gateway via IPaymentGateway.",
      "originalText": "⑥  PaymentService OrderPlacedHandler is a cascade — returns ProcessPaymentCommand. \n    Handler checks for existing Payment by OrderId (idempotency), creates Pending Payment, calls Stripe gateway via IPaymentGateway.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 900013,
      "version": 5,
      "versionNonce": 2134685613,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [],
      "boundElements": [],
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.4,
      "index": "b0K",
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "updated": 1779414782265,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "saga_step_7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1125,
      "y": 1185,
      "width": 826.109375,
      "height": 39.199999999999996,
      "text": "⑦  Gateway returns success or failure. Payment.MarkAsCompleted/Failed (status guard = idempotency). \n    Publish PaymentCompletedEvent or PaymentFailedEvent → payment-events.",
      "originalText": "⑦  Gateway returns success or failure. Payment.MarkAsCompleted/Failed (status guard = idempotency). \n    Publish PaymentCompletedEvent or PaymentFailedEvent → payment-events.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 900015,
      "version": 5,
      "versionNonce": 248576301,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [],
      "boundElements": [],
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.4,
      "index": "b0L",
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "updated": 1779414790952,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "saga_step_8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1125.0052013981358,
      "y": 1240.1612433422104,
      "width": 850.71875,
      "height": 39.199999999999996,
      "text": "⑧  payment-events fans out to 3 subs: order-payments-sub (OrderService transitions Order Placed→Paid), \n    shipping-payments-sub (creates shipment), notify-payments-sub.",
      "originalText": "⑧  payment-events fans out to 3 subs: order-payments-sub (OrderService transitions Order Placed→Paid), \n    shipping-payments-sub (creates shipment), notify-payments-sub.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 900017,
      "version": 6,
      "versionNonce": 1044334147,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [],
      "boundElements": [],
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.4,
      "index": "b0M",
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "updated": 1779414799280,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "saga_step_9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1125.1664447403462,
      "y": 1295,
      "width": 809.703125,
      "height": 39.199999999999996,
      "text": "⑨  ShippingService PaymentCompletedHandler cascades CreateShipmentCommand. Creates Shipment, runs \n    Dispatch() (Created→Dispatched), generates tracking number. Publish ShipmentDispatchedEvent.",
      "originalText": "⑨  ShippingService PaymentCompletedHandler cascades CreateShipmentCommand. Creates Shipment, runs \n    Dispatch() (Created→Dispatched), generates tracking number. Publish ShipmentDispatchedEvent.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 900019,
      "version": 6,
      "versionNonce": 144355149,
      "isDeleted": false,
